WEBVTT

00:53.511 --> 00:54.888
Okarun!

01:08.902 --> 01:10.820
Okarun! What's wrong?

01:10.904 --> 01:12.322
Are you okay?

01:15.533 --> 01:16.743
Crap!

01:26.920 --> 01:28.254
Sound.

01:28.338 --> 01:30.256
It's reacting to sound.

01:34.302 --> 01:36.888
But it's not reacting to our voices.

01:36.971 --> 01:40.558
Maybe it's only picking up
the sounds vibrating around this house.

01:44.145 --> 01:46.564
Hey, stop! What are you doing?

01:46.648 --> 01:50.860
Don't get in my way! Please let me die!

01:52.195 --> 01:53.196
Why...

02:25.854 --> 02:27.772
Please let me die...

02:31.442 --> 02:32.610
Why?

02:32.694 --> 02:34.404
What the hell is going on?

02:34.487 --> 02:36.447
Let me die...

02:38.575 --> 02:40.034
Momo! Don't! Stop!

02:43.454 --> 02:45.039
Something stabbed me.

02:45.123 --> 02:47.041
Nice one, cat! Wait, are you okay?

02:47.125 --> 02:48.626
What the hell?

02:48.710 --> 02:50.003
Ouch!

02:50.086 --> 02:53.256
Hey, dimwit! Tie that damn four-eyes up!

02:53.339 --> 02:54.632
O-Okay!

02:55.216 --> 02:56.759
I'm sorry, Okarun.

02:56.843 --> 03:00.305
When you're done there,
tie her up too, dumbass!

03:00.388 --> 03:02.140
I'm sorry, Momo.

03:02.891 --> 03:04.183
Damn it!

03:04.267 --> 03:06.853
What's going on? Why is this happening?

03:06.936 --> 03:08.396
Psychic waves.

03:09.022 --> 03:11.441
That earthworm is emitting psychic waves.

03:11.524 --> 03:14.944
It's trying to make people
inside the house commit suicide.

03:15.028 --> 03:16.487
Impossible.

03:16.571 --> 03:19.157
Then, because of that thing, my parents...

03:19.240 --> 03:22.452
But, if so, why am I fine?

03:22.535 --> 03:25.496
Huh? You haven't noticed yet?

03:28.666 --> 03:30.209
Momo! Stop it!

04:44.117 --> 04:45.243
Ouch...

04:45.952 --> 04:47.412
Come on, me.

04:47.495 --> 04:48.788
Don't give up.

04:52.917 --> 04:54.544
Okarun! Momo!

04:54.627 --> 04:56.254
Come on, stop it!

04:57.297 --> 04:59.507
I'm begging you! Snap out of it!

04:59.590 --> 05:01.968
Let me die!

07:02.588 --> 07:03.506
You're...

07:08.553 --> 07:10.096
Jiji, cut these handcuffs!

07:10.179 --> 07:12.223
I don't know why,
but I've regained my sanity!

07:12.306 --> 07:13.766
Momo! Okarun!

07:13.850 --> 07:15.435
I'm sorry about this, Mr. Jiji!

07:15.518 --> 07:17.061
More like, what is this guy?

07:18.396 --> 07:20.857
We regained our sanity thanks to him?

07:23.359 --> 07:24.777
Whoa, gross!

07:25.445 --> 07:27.655
Don't look it in the eye!

07:28.489 --> 07:30.032
That's Evil Eye!

07:30.116 --> 07:33.911
His evil gaze will make people
go insane and commit suicide!

07:34.495 --> 07:35.580
Suicide?

07:35.663 --> 07:38.124
That's the same as the psychic waves
from that earthworm!

07:38.791 --> 07:40.668
Yeah. The Evil Eye's curse

07:40.751 --> 07:43.963
and the earthworm's psychic waves
are canceling each other out!

07:44.046 --> 07:47.133
I don't really get it,
but the earthworm isn't moving!

07:47.216 --> 07:49.051
Okarun, get it!

07:49.844 --> 07:51.095
What a drag.

07:51.679 --> 07:53.931
Time to go full throttle.

07:59.145 --> 08:01.647
All right! You severed its head!

08:01.731 --> 08:03.524
Wait, how far did he fly off to?

08:08.404 --> 08:11.532
It grew a new mouth! That's not fair!

08:11.616 --> 08:13.242
Don't look it in the eye!

08:13.326 --> 08:14.827
It wasn't your fault, was it?

08:14.911 --> 08:16.913
My parents didn't end up like that
because of you!

08:19.081 --> 08:20.291
Jiji!

10:07.607 --> 10:09.567
Just once...

10:10.901 --> 10:14.280
I wanted to play with...

10:15.114 --> 10:16.324
the others.

10:26.167 --> 10:28.711
Huh? He's still alive?

10:28.794 --> 10:30.838
He's wriggling around.

11:21.639 --> 11:23.099
There's a ghost!

11:23.933 --> 11:26.018
Hey! We're still eating!

11:26.102 --> 11:28.854
Right there! In front of us!
There's a ghost!

11:29.397 --> 11:31.232
There's no such thing.

12:04.223 --> 12:07.059
There's something down below!

12:10.104 --> 12:13.774
That was so sudden.
What will you do with the kid?

12:13.858 --> 12:16.152
He's an offering
to the Great Serpent Lord.

12:16.735 --> 12:18.612
We'll bury him, house and all.

12:19.613 --> 12:21.282
That's her!

12:22.116 --> 12:25.703
I feel sorry for him,
but this is to protect the village.

12:25.786 --> 12:28.914
It's our duty as members
of the Kito Family.

12:28.998 --> 12:32.877
NO ENTRY

12:59.570 --> 13:01.113
I will never...

13:02.281 --> 13:04.158
ever forgive them.

13:04.742 --> 13:06.452
Kill...

13:06.535 --> 13:08.078
I'll kill them.

13:10.039 --> 13:12.124
Look this way.

13:12.708 --> 13:15.628
Look at me!

13:18.130 --> 13:19.131
Jiji!

13:20.049 --> 13:23.802
Get a grip! There's no time
to be dealing with that one!

13:23.886 --> 13:26.514
What's with him? He won't get away at all!

13:26.597 --> 13:29.225
Stop, Momo! He's different!

13:29.308 --> 13:30.809
He's not a bad guy!

13:30.893 --> 13:32.228
What, really?

13:32.311 --> 13:35.022
He's been fighting alone this whole time!

13:35.105 --> 13:36.857
He's been suffering all along!

13:37.608 --> 13:39.902
Wait, Jiji! Where are you going?

13:40.569 --> 13:43.656
Your body is down here, right?

13:44.281 --> 13:47.076
Jiji, wait. What's gotten into you?

13:49.745 --> 13:53.832
What the heck? The lower we go,
the older the houses get.

13:53.916 --> 13:57.753
Are these all the houses that were built
right here, along the years?

13:58.837 --> 14:01.966
Just you wait. I'll get you out right now.

14:32.621 --> 14:34.874
What the hell is up with you?

14:34.957 --> 14:36.333
What is this place?

14:41.338 --> 14:44.049
You were trapped down here for so long.

14:44.800 --> 14:48.220
You were protecting me this whole time?

14:48.721 --> 14:49.638
Stop it!

14:49.722 --> 14:51.724
Don't get any closer to him!

14:51.807 --> 14:53.726
Don't show him any sympathy!

14:53.809 --> 14:57.229
That guy is a yokai
that drives humans to suicide!

14:57.313 --> 14:59.982
No! He's just like us!

15:01.108 --> 15:05.070
He may look different,
but he's the same as us.

15:05.154 --> 15:08.032
He's not the same!
You don't get it at all!

15:08.115 --> 15:10.826
Hold on! Both of you, calm down!

15:10.910 --> 15:12.661
What the hell is this?

15:21.587 --> 15:24.548
Ouch! What was that?

15:24.632 --> 15:27.051
My vision went white for a sec.

15:27.134 --> 15:28.677
Ow.

15:30.054 --> 15:31.055
Huh?

15:35.893 --> 15:38.896
Whoa, crap! It's super sticky!

15:38.979 --> 15:40.940
You dense turd nuggets.

15:41.023 --> 15:42.024
Gimme a break!

15:42.107 --> 15:44.485
What happened to your good luck?

15:44.568 --> 15:47.321
My luck doesn't belong to anyone.

15:47.404 --> 15:50.366
Perhaps the good luck went to the enemy.

15:50.449 --> 15:52.034
What's up with that?

15:52.117 --> 15:56.413
Sheesh! Where the hell did Okarun go?

15:58.874 --> 16:01.961
My body is paralyzed... Can't move...

16:02.670 --> 16:05.756
In any case, we have to get out of here.

16:10.844 --> 16:11.720
All right!

16:11.804 --> 16:14.348
Jiji, can you grab onto me?
We'll make our escape!

16:18.978 --> 16:20.104
Jiji?

16:20.187 --> 16:21.772
Hold on, what's wrong?

16:21.855 --> 16:22.856
Jiji!

16:22.940 --> 16:24.233
Jiji!

16:47.631 --> 16:48.924
I'm sorry.

16:49.008 --> 16:50.801
I've hated you for so long.

16:50.884 --> 16:54.263
I was scared,
and I thought it was your fault.

16:54.888 --> 16:57.474
But you were going through so much pain.

16:59.768 --> 17:01.645
I wanna play...

17:01.729 --> 17:04.189
I wanna play...

17:04.773 --> 17:06.025
Huh?

17:12.406 --> 17:14.658
I wanna play...

17:15.159 --> 17:16.368
Together...

17:16.452 --> 17:18.328
Okay! Here we go!

17:18.412 --> 17:21.790
Let's play together a whole ton!
Whatcha wanna play?

17:24.501 --> 17:26.628
A lifetime isn't even enough!

17:26.712 --> 17:28.797
I'll hang out with you
as much as you want!

17:36.096 --> 17:38.515
You finally said it.

17:52.112 --> 17:52.946
Jiji?

17:53.030 --> 17:55.199
You idiot! That's why I told you!

17:55.282 --> 17:57.993
You shouldn't trust Evil Eye!

18:02.414 --> 18:04.792
It shocked us again!

18:43.956 --> 18:47.960
Finally, I have acquired this body.

18:48.043 --> 18:50.629
It's time to murder all the humans.

18:50.712 --> 18:53.090
Jiji, that thing...
Is that Evil Eye's power?

18:53.173 --> 18:55.342
Hey, brace yourself! Or he'll get ya!

18:57.928 --> 18:58.971
Jiji?

19:07.104 --> 19:10.649
You possess a strange power.

19:10.732 --> 19:14.361
You turd nugget! Don't get cocky, scumbag!

19:14.444 --> 19:16.613
You are a yokai, I see.

19:16.697 --> 19:19.074
Have you become enslaved by humans?

19:19.158 --> 19:21.326
Watch what you say.

19:21.410 --> 19:24.079
I'll beat you to a bloody pulp!

19:24.163 --> 19:26.206
Jiji! Snap out of it!

19:26.290 --> 19:28.709
What happened to your usual idiotic hype?

19:28.792 --> 19:30.919
Who are you speaking to?

19:31.545 --> 19:34.214
This vessel is now mine.

19:34.298 --> 19:38.218
I will now show humans
what they consider hell.

19:46.935 --> 19:47.978
Amazing!

19:48.687 --> 19:52.482
In this cursed house,
where grudges will never be rid.

19:52.566 --> 19:53.567
In this cursed house,

19:53.650 --> 19:57.446
the deep grudges of all
the murdered will reject everything.

20:31.855 --> 20:32.981
Damn you.

20:33.065 --> 20:35.234
You keep escaping into the dirt.

20:41.281 --> 20:42.783
Ow.

20:42.866 --> 20:44.618
Seriously, what is going on here?

20:44.701 --> 20:46.662
Why did Jiji end up like that?

20:46.745 --> 20:49.164
You're really a dense one, huh?

20:49.248 --> 20:52.042
Seiko mentioned it so many times.

20:52.125 --> 20:53.085
Huh?

20:53.669 --> 20:55.629
That guy is a genius.

20:55.712 --> 20:57.547
You've grown up into quite the genius.

20:57.631 --> 20:58.715
Are you a genius?

20:58.799 --> 21:01.009
You really are a genius.

21:01.093 --> 21:06.431
It's not often you see such
an ingeniously strong spiritual power.

21:06.515 --> 21:08.976
And, his physical power
is high on top of it.

21:09.643 --> 21:13.522
Evil Eye was targeting him
to use as his vessel.

21:13.605 --> 21:16.858
I wish I could have possessed him myself.

21:16.942 --> 21:17.985
No way.

21:18.527 --> 21:22.781
Jiji didn't feel like that
at all back in grade school!

21:22.864 --> 21:25.367
Each person has
their own timing for awakening.

21:25.450 --> 21:30.080
It's only recently that you came
to that power yourself.

21:32.958 --> 21:35.585
Hunker down, Momo.

21:36.169 --> 21:38.422
He's not on your side.

22:12.164 --> 22:13.081
Okarun.

22:13.165 --> 22:15.959
You bastard, you punched Momo-chan.

22:16.043 --> 22:17.836
You're not getting away with that!

23:53.640 --> 23:55.559
- You won't get away with this.
- Nope, you won't.

23:55.642 --> 23:56.810
Did someone do something?

23:56.893 --> 24:00.355
Humans are creatures that
just accidentally mutter that sometimes.

24:00.438 --> 24:01.648
I totally get it.

24:01.731 --> 24:03.316
Next episode,
"You Won't Get Away With This!"

24:03.400 --> 24:05.152
So who won't be getting away with what?

24:05.235 --> 24:07.946
Wait, I feel like
we had this conversation before.
